

### Create user 1
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### Create user 2
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beto",
  "email": "beto@test.com",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### Create a group (Ana is creator)
POST http://localhost:8080/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trip",
  "creatorEmail": "ana@test.com"
}

### Add Beto to group 1 (Ana is current user / owner)
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/152/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentUserId": 152,
  "newMemberId": 153
}

### Create an expense: Ana paid 60, split 30/30
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/152/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paidById": 152,
  "amount": 60,
  "date": "2026-07-28",
  "description": "Dinner",
  "shares": { "152": 30, "153": 30 }
}

### Get balances
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/152/balances

### Get settle suggestion
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/152/settle

